  "question": "设 $y(x - y)^2 = x$ ，求 $\\int \\frac{1}{x - 3y} \\mathrm{d}x$ .",
  "answer": "= \\int \\frac {t}{t ^ {2} - 1} d t = \\frac {1}{2} \\ln | t ^ {2} - 1 | + C = \\frac {1}{2} \\ln | (x - y) ^ {2} - 1 | + C.",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "分部积分法",
    "换元积分法"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 由所给的隐函数方程难以得到函数的显表达式 $y = y(x)$ （或 $x = x(x)$ ），较好的方法是将隐函数化为参数式函数，再做积分。积分后消去参数。"
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "已知 $y(x - y)^2 = x$ ，令 $x - y = t$ ，则 $y = x - t$ ，代入前式，得 $(x - t)t^2 = x$ ，可得"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "$$\nx = \\frac {t ^ {3}}{t ^ {2} - 1}, \\quad y = \\frac {t}{t ^ {2} - 1}, \\quad \\mathrm{d} x = \\frac {t ^ {2} (t ^ {2} - 3)}{(t ^ {2} - 1) ^ {2}} \\mathrm{d} t,"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "\\int \\frac {\\mathrm{d} x}{x - 3 y} = \\int \\frac {1}{\\frac {t ^ {3}}{t ^ {2} - 1} - \\frac {3 t}{t ^ {2} - 1}} \\cdot \\frac {t ^ {2} (t ^ {2} - 3)}{(t ^ {2} - 1) ^ {2}} \\mathrm{d} t = \\int \\frac {t ^ {2} - 1}{t (t ^ {2} - 3)} \\cdot \\frac {t ^ {2} (t ^ {2} - 3)}{(t ^ {2} - 1) ^ {2}} \\mathrm{d} t"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "= \\int \\frac {t}{t ^ {2} - 1} d t = \\frac {1}{2} \\ln | t ^ {2} - 1 | + C = \\frac {1}{2} \\ln | (x - y) ^ {2} - 1 | + C.\n$$"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "= \\int \\frac {t}{t ^ {2} - 1} d t = \\frac {1}{2} \\ln | t ^ {2} - 1 | + C = \\frac {1}{2} \\ln | (x - y) ^ {2} - 1 | + C.",
    "techniques_used": [
      "分部积分法",
      "换元积分法"
    ]
  },
